    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "that sounds like something from a movie. in reality, some things are just broken beyond repair. the shame is constant. it's like a weight that never lifts, and honestly, the idea of \"starting over\" just sounds exhausting. why keep fighting for a life that doesn't even belong to me anymore? it would be so much easier to just stop feeling this.",
